{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-19_beg","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-19","title":"萬千願景","storyCode":"14-21","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-19_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9b79e5b29e4f8b7a99ddaaa3f9b359043d6b5b2f93343146e09edf83086dfd7f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g12_babeltop_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛發生的事，並不是幻覺啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"天地在轉瞬間完成了翻轉。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"奇怪，我的身體並沒有任何的不適感。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要被內化宇宙之中的任何規則變動干擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡本不該成為生靈可以踏足的地方，用我們的思維去衡量真實與幻境的界限毫無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抬頭看看現在的天空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是羅德島航行的金色海洋……那片海洋倒懸在我們的上方？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，我看到了羅德島……還有那些湧動的浪潮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眾魂仍然呼喚我，它們想要傾瀉而下淹沒我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生仍在對抗眾魂……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，天上地下怎麼變都無所謂，告訴我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下在哪？看起來她根本不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，這地方讓我莫名覺得很舒服——毛骨悚然的那種——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可剛才那個呼喚我的聲音……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那的確是特蕾西婭小姐的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……眾魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的確在這裡，我們已經找到她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老女人，別和我打啞謎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你睜大眼睛看看，這裡除了那些莫名其妙的大柱子，哪還有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她突然頓住了。\n柱子。塔。眾魂。特蕾西婭。\n她突然明白了她靈魂深處產生的舒適感來自何處。\n眾魂在此紮根，紅色的根系紮根於此，龐大到足以貫通天地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些白色的長柱……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是特蕾西婭小姐的意志，她在試圖穩定這座塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一直在看著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"內化宇宙中的時間分明已經停滯，但這個奇蹟仍在生長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至試圖突破我們腳下所踩踏的“天空”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或許已經突破了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她真的能突破這裡的限制，那就說明——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看我幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我總得試試看踩的這東西夠不夠結實吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想好不容易見到殿下的時候，被她突然扔下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這片所謂的“天空”，恐怕沒有這麼簡單吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我特意準備的炸藥，可沒能在上面留下任何的痕跡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"物理層面的破壞力不可能撼動這裡絲毫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡本就是由超越泰拉認知的規則和數量龐大到不可思議的資料所編織的“限制”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不容挑戰，不容更改。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你少唬我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你擺明了又瞞著些什麼。兜帽人說得沒錯，這座塔分明已經突破了你所說的“限制”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，我知道你身上藏了一些秘密，甚至是兜帽人和小兔子都不知道的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從來沒來過這裡，但你卻對這裡的許多東西熟悉到不可思議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你臉上的表情藏得很好，但還騙不過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，不要隨意行動——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們拖不起時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是殿下因為等我們等太久睡著了，總得有人來給沒電的鬧鐘換上電池吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希，她沒看起來那麼魯莽。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，幫個忙，我得確認一件事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一開始就很好奇，這個鬼地方連太陽和月亮都沒有，地面上又哪來的影子呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她將自己手中的閃光彈拋向了上方。炸彈沒有落下，而是不斷向上。\n自“天空”升起一輪白日，不斷飛向金色海洋，照出了一團模糊的影子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，在那！那個完全驅散不掉的影子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他竟然也在這裡……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是……死魂靈？！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"阿米婭，小心再次遭到他的攻擊！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有感受到任何的敵意，就像是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒有注意到我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，要不要動手？我和他之間的帳還沒算完呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這個奇怪的地方，他總該知道點什麼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐，先等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的狀態……很奇怪。他和我們剛才見到的眾魂不一樣，獨自等在這裡，不願離開……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個老東西在這裡，是不是表示他也已經死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，W小姐，他很好。應該說……前所未有地好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已完全平靜，我感受到了，飽含悲傷的平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下……到底對他做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐救了他，她留住了死魂靈臨近崩潰的最後一絲意識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅如此……他原本混亂無序的思緒現在也變得清晰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下還治好了他的瘋病？等等，現在的殿下還能做到這種事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐現在到底是什麼樣的狀態……我也無從得知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，能否和死魂靈建立溝通？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當下最接近真相的線索，或許就在他的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以試試……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的波紋自阿米婭的身邊開始蕩開，輕柔的波紋觸碰了黑色的陰影。\n陰影流動，回應著魔王的低語。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後到這裡的，果然還是你們。"},{"type":"narration","text":"模糊的陰影“張口”言語。他不再怒吼，聲音出奇地冷靜。\n像是一個遲暮的老人，經歷了數千年時光的煎熬，忽得一剎那的心境清明，他的怒火終於被撫平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂靈閣下，您出現在這裡並非偶然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭……拯救了我，將本該消失的殘魂挽留了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是跟隨她，來到此處……見證改變薩卡茲整個族群命運的時刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說特蕾西婭……殿下在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已離去，將自原初中取回種子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"種子……是“阿喃那”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿喃那”難道不是已經在薩卡茲的控制中了？特蕾西婭小姐……還想要做到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石，塑造了這片大地上的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們有無數種辦法利用源石的力量，但從來沒有人，能真正掌控它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而殿下……她做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說過，她將會從苦難的源頭盜來火種。給予我們詛咒的源石，會成為重塑我們生命的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲將擁有一片無瑕的花圃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你是說，從根源上控制源石……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，在我們經歷了如此之多後，我想你應該能理解這意味著什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"特蕾西婭，在搶奪源石的“權限”。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭和特雷西斯所謀算的未來，已經遠遠超越了這片大地所有知識所能涉及的極限。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我不能放任源石變成毀滅一切的武器。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"沒有多餘的疑問，凱爾希沉默地看著你。你們已經共同經歷太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老東西看來是真的清醒過來了……原來你除了叨叨些什麼復仇、什麼苦難，還是能說些人話的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在很久很久以前，我也只是一個普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在先前漫長的生命裡，曾因為許多事憤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先民的侵略，薩科塔的背叛，卡茲戴爾的衰敗……還有眾魂對我的拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到我來到此處，我終於知曉，眾魂原本的樣貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我只感到悲哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？你怎麼又開始說顛三倒四的話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒有看到，那片金色的海洋上，眾魂的模樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有薩卡茲，終其一生都在抵抗不公義的命運，而死亡並非解脫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所謂眾魂，不過是留存在這片空間裡的破碎資訊，還要在另一種意志下，忍受另一種禁錮……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，殿下說，她會蕩清煉獄，解救所有薩卡茲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，你跟這個老傢伙聊得來，能不能翻譯一下他到底在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭，她已經能夠修改源石中的訊息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是她的承諾，特蕾西婭，從不食言……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"死魂靈的陰影","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，終於……特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？殿下在哪？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，你腳下的影子！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"影子？\n這裡本沒有光明，我的影子又是從何而來？\n不，這不是我的影子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭低下頭，透過自己踩踏的“天空”，看到了那個正在漫步的白色身影。\n“天空”與“天空之外”。\n特蕾西婭，阿米婭。一層之隔，互為倒影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“阿米婭……”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"輕盈的呢喃在耳畔響起，阿米婭抬起頭，她已站在了自己身側。\n牽起了自己的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g15_origindecisivebattlefield"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，戰場環境……又變化了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，地面……重新開始湧動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜，守住你的防線，不要分心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碎片大廈上那個奇怪的東西，突然激發了什麼奇怪的能量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果……諸王之息的效果失效——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維持全員警戒！聯軍指揮部向所有艦隊通報了至少七處地形突變坐標！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少三艘亞伯寇恩公爵所屬突擊艦被摧毀，還有兩支阿什沃思公爵的偵察機動部隊突然失去了訊號——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，通知你周邊的所有隊伍停止進攻C-9高地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接從兩邊散開，否則那些源石的波浪……會吞噬我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道了！大伙已經動起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，還有一個超級壞消息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者的那處營地裡，那個本來空空的王座上看上去有人了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者之王……回來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，霧氣……霧氣開始變得更濃厚了。那些薩卡茲反撲得很厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角小姐，拜託你和風笛小姐指揮大伙配合聯軍部隊的指令協同作戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們更熟悉正規軍的指令，其他部隊也會支援我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦失去這處隘口，我們之前取得的優勢會蕩然無存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我協助你們，怎麼處理這些東西我也有點經驗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，快看，“榮光”號……正在快速結晶化，薩卡茲的部隊還在圍攻那裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開斯特公爵，還在艦上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，維多利亞不能接受再有一個公爵死在戰場上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"電流聲響起，維多利亞方所有的通訊頻道裡，都響起同一個聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雜亂的通訊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“榮光”號總指揮，開斯特公爵，向所有聯軍戰士講話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雜亂的通訊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們都看到了，來自魔族的暴君正在撕裂我們祖國的土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雜亂的通訊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不論敵人展現出何等野蠻、充滿惡意的侵略手段，都無法動搖我們捍衛領土的決心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雜亂的通訊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要我們的艦船與部隊的力量仍能……滋……只要我們所有人善盡職責……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雜亂的通訊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這即是維多利亞議會——以及每個人的決心。公爵與人民，將領與士兵……滋……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雜亂的通訊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此刻，敵人重新爬上了“榮光”號殘缺的艦頭，源石正在吞噬我們的堡壘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雜亂的通訊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但與你們所有絕不退縮的戰士一樣，我，開斯特，從未退縮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雜亂的通訊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……滋……我會指揮部隊走上最前線，站在你們的身邊……滋……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雜亂的通訊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們腳下的土地，就是維多利亞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開斯特公爵……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他……瘋了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜，蒸汽騎士早就“瘋”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我沒看錯吧……蒸汽騎士……撞上了“榮光”號？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他撞上的是快要完全結晶化的劍座和諸王之息……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他到底想做什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他想要拯救他的“維多利亞”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"戰場後方心驚膽戰的士兵都聽到了從“榮光”號上傳來的異響。\n甲胄不斷在劍座旁行動，踩踏每一個試圖染指劍座的魔族。\n可他無論做什麼，都無法改變源石的擴散。\n“維多利亞！！”\n他在怒吼著，他捶打著大地，但他卻無能為力。源石終將吞噬國劍——\n於是他衝了上去，向敵人衝鋒，向被吞噬的『榮光』號衝鋒，向源石衝鋒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"源石結晶碎裂，巨大的衝力將諸王之息高高拋起，落在了維娜身前。所有人睜大眼睛看著這不可思議的一幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"維娜拔出了那把已經陪伴她許久的劍。\n她舉起劍，指向源源不絕衝鋒而來的敵人和席捲而來的迷霧。沒有後退一步。\n回應她的是衝鋒的怒吼，還有劃過天空衝入戰場的蒸汽聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g12_babeltop_ex"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你長大了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的語氣，依舊如阿米婭記憶中——溫柔，平淡。\n但阿米婭知道，眼前之人，和那個曾將自己攬在懷中，徹夜講故事的特蕾西婭小姐不一樣了。\n阿米婭曾有千萬困惑，希望留待見面這一刻求得解答。\n但此時她卻什麼都說不出，問不了。\n因為特蕾西婭不允許。\n……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，阿米婭，我聽見了你內心的疑惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不能回答──所有的回答，所有的解釋都蒼白無力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意外造就了我們的重聚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許連我也在期待這一刻吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，凱爾希，W……還有，博士。你們已經來到了我的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真切地為這場重聚而感到喜悅，你能感受到的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"為什麼？\n明明已經很確定，理應不再有任何猶豫——\n眼前的這個人，絕對不會是特蕾西婭。\n可不只是容顏，這個人的一舉一動、表情與眼神，還有流露出的情緒，為什麼都和特蕾西婭小姐一模一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是……特蕾西婭小姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是發自內心這樣認為的嗎？阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認識的……特蕾西婭小姐……絕對不會做出這種事……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死……我明明都想好了，可看著這張臉，我也只能叫出“殿下”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，您還記得我，在我十幾年的傭兵生涯裡，沒有比這更榮幸的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是這個場合，我真的想不顧一切擁抱您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，在您不知道的地方……您也不用知道——我在心底已經和您做過無數次的告別了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說真的很矯情……可是，殿下，您對我而言是最特殊的人。您讓一個流浪的雇傭兵看到了一些很不一樣的風景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，在這裡幹掉您，就是我對您最好的報答了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還會稱呼我為“殿下”，你們還記得，我是薩卡茲的“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼我要做的，只有捍衛薩卡茲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西婭小姐到底做了什麼？！\n阿米婭回望身後，卻已是另一幅光景。\n——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"白色的長柱猛烈地生長。無可測量的無限之“塔”開始極速地“下墜”。\n唯有自己所站立的地方……\n特蕾西婭的身邊，保留了永恆的寧靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，這座塔真美啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它會永不停歇地生長下去，突破一切限制，為改寫薩卡茲宿命的花圃撐起一片天地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我多想讓你們看到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你們不被允許留在這裡，意外需要消除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你們站在我的面前，你們就是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的敵人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不。\n黑色的王冠在阿米婭的頭頂浮現。\n我絕不承認，特蕾西婭小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
